Context('Numeric');
$p = random(50, 150, 10);
$r = 1 + $p/100;
$expression = Formula("$r x");

######
# Body
######

BEGIN_PGML
If a population of [`x`] fish is introduced into a large, predator-free lake with ample food, then one year later the population will have grown by [`[$p]`] percent. Find an expression for the population one year later.

[_]{$expression}{20}

END_PGML

